{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reng Azure Requiem</strong> is a <strong>2D Action-Adventure game</strong> that mixes Metroidvania and a Soulslike challenge in the non-linear world of <strong>Tartarius</strong>, where your choices define your final destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat with Teleportation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-direction Teleportation replaces the traditional jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the mystical blue sword with strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raven\u2019s Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon the Raven for combat or transform into it for exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP by defeating enemies and collect experience grave markers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Sacred Statues</strong> to spend your upgrade points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 upgradeable abilities: damage, speed, teleport, resistance, shield, extra soul, and Raven powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your upgrade choices shape your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Metroidvania Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is interconnected by portals for exploration and saving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each portal leads to a unique region that hides secrets, bosses, and unique challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soul Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul weakens over time \u2014 warm yourself at <strong>Spiritual Bonfires</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges and Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices between Combat and Redemption determine your path through the game's 4 main acts in the search for the soul's resurrection.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810600?t=1769143877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810600/c3425f5c29208953f2fa2db5d873ab6a9d5c7860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769143877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810600/eb1e19fd4531a36bed6300bf8f61b444fe2dea16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769143877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810600/eb1e19fd4531a36bed6300bf8f61b444fe2dea16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769143877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reng Azure Requiem</strong> is a <strong>2D Action-Adventure game</strong> that mixes Metroidvania and a Soulslike challenge in the non-linear world of <strong>Tartarius</strong>, where your choices define your final destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat with Teleportation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-direction Teleportation replaces the traditional jump.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the mystical blue sword with strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raven\u2019s Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon the Raven for combat or transform into it for exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP by defeating enemies and collect experience grave markers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Sacred Statues</strong> to spend your upgrade points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 upgradeable abilities: damage, speed, teleport, resistance, shield, extra soul, and Raven powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your upgrade choices shape your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Metroidvania Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is interconnected by portals for exploration and saving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each portal leads to a unique region that hides secrets, bosses, and unique challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soul Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul weakens over time \u2014 warm yourself at <strong>Spiritual Bonfires</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges and Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices between Combat and Redemption determine your path through the game's 4 main acts in the search for the soul's resurrection.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gabriel Henrique"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Gabriel Henrique Pereira da Cruz do Nascimento ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810600/cd81b4c6cc12a67982df51cd5b9d615309237fe6/header.jpg?t=176914